WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:03.255
Welcome to this beginner's guide to Google Stitch.

00:00:03.255 --> 00:00:08.137
Stitch uses artificial intelligence to turn your ideas into app and website designs.

00:00:09.087 --> 00:00:12.969
You can start with a written prompt, or upload a sketch or a screen capture.

00:00:13.919 --> 00:00:16.126
Choose App or Web, then click Generate.

00:00:16.126 --> 00:00:17.994
Stitch builds the design for you.

00:00:18.944 --> 00:00:23.360
It creates a style sheet first, then every screen, all in one matching look.

00:00:24.310 --> 00:00:28.001
You can edit the design, then preview it as a clickable prototype.

00:00:28.951 --> 00:00:33.260
Finally, share a link, so that people can test your design on their own phones.

00:00:34.210 --> 00:00:36.711
Follow the steps below at your own pace.

00:00:36.711 --> 00:00:37.837
Let's get started.

